From 4daf675fd77ae7762b6499b7adbc0b039ddb5620 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JSwetz <Johnswetz1982@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 07:05:38 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] fix(mcp): require mutual token proof and line limits on UI
 link

Enforce mutual token proof handshake during UI link connection, bound CLI
answer reads to 16 MiB, and probe process liveness on Windows.

Changelog: UI link: verify token proof from window and bound line reads
Fixes #3874
